<title>SWEDEN: Sweden sets auction of 15 bln skr T-bills  PMRU.</title>
<headline>Sweden sets auction of 15 bln skr T-bills  PMRU.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's National Debt Office said on Tuesday it was to auction 15 billion crowns worth of seven-day Treasury bills.</p>
<p>The office said all dealers are invited to place bids by 1000 GMT on March 18 at the latest.</p>
<p>The paper will mature on March 26.</p>
<p>The lowest accepted bid volume is 100 million crowns.</p>
<p>-- Belinda Goldsmith, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1017</p>
